reignition-briefing =
    Commander, the Crimson Tide is testing three temporal research hubs in this sector.

    Deploy your MCV and build a refinery to unlock the Chrono Maneuver terminal.
    Iris tanks can deploy with F: gain range and fire rate, but cannot move until undeployed.
    Buran tanks deploy to reduce incoming damage.
    Nearby power plants gain output; linked sentry guns and Tesla coils gain range.

    Destroy or capture all three research hubs. Protect your harvesters and power plants.
    Optional: Capture the forward radar dome to mark every research hub.

reignition-establish-base = Deploy the MCV and build a refinery
reignition-destroy-labs = Destroy or capture all three temporal research hubs
reignition-capture-radar = Optional: Capture the radar dome to mark the targets

reignition-actor-iris = Iris Medium Tank
reignition-actor-iris-description = Mobile medium tank. Press F to deploy: +50% weapon range, +25% fire rate, immobile while deployed. Move to undeploy.
reignition-actor-buran = Buran Medium Tank
reignition-actor-buran-description = Heavy medium tank. Press F to deploy: 25% damage resistance, immobile while deployed. Move to undeploy.
